k Ye'cuc ve Me'cuc bu seti ne aşabildiler ne de delebildiler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو یاجوج و ماجوج اس پر نہ چڑھ سکے اور نہ اس میں سوراخ کرسکے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka mereka tidak bisa mendakinya dan mereka tidak bisa (pula) melobanginya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱسْطَٰعُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَظْهَرُوهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d6510ea80c00489f6535.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "da se popnu na njega", "en": "to scale it", "tr": "ona tırmanmaları için", "fr": "l'escalader", "id": "untuk mendakinya", "ur": "(کہ) اس پر چڑھ سکیں", "bn": "তার উপরে উঠতে", "fa": "از آن بالا روند"}}, {"text": "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱسْتَطَٰعُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَقْبًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "ظَهَرَ", "count": 4, "first": "6:151", "audio": "audio/f6ad6472ddf6d614ef62.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it appeared", "bs": "pojavio se", "tr": "göründü", "fr": "il est apparu", "id": "dia muncul", "ur": "وہ ظاہر ہوا", "bn": "সে আবির্ভূত হলো", "fa": "پدیدار شد"}}, {"arabic": "يَظْهَرُوا۟", "count": 3, "first": "9:8", "audio": "audio/303b1ef78a618df3013b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}, {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}], "gloss": {"en": "they prevail; they are aware", "bs": "nadvladavaju; znaju", "tr": "galip gelirler; bilirler", "fr": "ils dominent ; ils savent", "id": "mereka mengalahkan; mereka mengetahui", "ur": "وہ غالب آتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা জয়ী হয়; তারা সচেতন", "fa": "چیره شوند؛ بدانند"}}, {"arabic": "وَظَهَرَ", "count": 1, "first": "9:48", "audio": "audio/10b8365c1d4eae140dc4.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and he/it appeared", "bs": "i pojavio se", "tr": "ve göründü", "fr": "et il est apparu", "id": "dan dia telah muncul", "ur": "اور وہ ظاہر ہوا", "bn": "এবং সে আবির্ভূত হলো", "fa": "و پدیدار شد"}}, {"arabic": "يَظْهَرُوهُ", "count": 1, "first": "18:97", "audio": "audio/d6510ea80c00489f6535.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"bs": "da se popnu na njega", "en": "to scale it", "tr": "ona tırmanmaları için", "fr": "l'escalader", "id": "untuk mendakinya", "ur": "(کہ) اس پر چڑھ سکیں", "bn": "তার উপরে উঠতে", "fa": "از آن بالا روند"}}, {"arabic": "يَظْهَرُونَ", "count": 1, "first": "43:33", "audio": "audio/2dbdbbc7d012a705e521.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "they scale", "bs": "penju se", "tr": "tırmanırlar", "fr": "ils grimpent", "id": "mereka mendaki", "ur": "وہ چڑھتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা আরোহণ করে", "fa": "بالا می‌روند"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0303.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0303.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0303.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0303.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0303.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "ظَهَرَ الْقَمَرُ", "spoken": "audio/f6b9793f22fc30a3a6c8.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Pojavio se mjesec.", "en": "The moon appeared.", "bn": "চাঁদ উঠল।", "fa": "ماه نمایان شد.", "fr": "La lune est apparue.", "id": "Bulan tampak.", "tr": "Ay göründü.", "ur": "چاند ظاہر ہوا۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "ظَهَرَ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "pojavio se", "en": "appeared", "bn": "প্রকাশ পেল", "fa": "نمایان شد", "fr": "est appa